---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Tools" image="/images/tools-troll.jpg" description="Small tools for coaches from Doubleskull Tales. The Odds Desk for dodges, rushes and pick-ups, the Block Desk for everything that hits, the Pass Desk for the brave, the Foul Desk for the rest of us.">
  <div class="page tl-page">
    <p class="tl-kicker">Tools · For coaches</p>
    <h1>Tools</h1>
    <p class="tl-intro"><em>Small helpers for the moments between "I've got this" and "why did I do that". They run in your browser, they're free, and they don't judge. Much.</em></p>

    <figure class="tl-hero"><img src="/images/tools-troll.jpg" alt="A troll sits on a crate at the sideline, counting on his fingers and sliding beads on a tiny abacus, while a nervous goblin holds up a measuring ruler." width="1200" height="670" /><figcaption>Our head of analytics, hard at work. Illustrations: AI-generated.</figcaption></figure>

    <div class="tl-grid">
      <a class="tl-card" href="/tools/odds-desk/">
        <img class="tl-head" src="/images/tool-head-odds.jpg" alt="A sweaty human blitzer doing sums in his head" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="tl-label">Dice maths</span>
        <span class="tl-title">The Odds Desk</span>
        <span class="tl-text">Dodge, rush, pick-up, pass, catch: line up your rolls and see your real chances, with team re-roll, skills, Pro and Loner spent in the smartest order.</span>
        <span class="btn dark tl-btn">Open the Odds Desk</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tl-card" href="/tools/block-desk/">
        <img class="tl-head" src="/images/tool-head-block.jpg" alt="A grinning orc in a battered helmet" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="tl-label">Dice maths</span>
        <span class="tl-title">The Block Desk</span>
        <span class="tl-text">Strength, assists and all the usual hitting skills: see how often he goes down, how often you do, and how often he leaves on a stretcher.</span>
        <span class="btn dark tl-btn">Open the Block Desk</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tl-card" href="/tools/pass-desk/">
        <img class="tl-head" src="/images/tool-head-pass.jpg" alt="A smug high elf" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="tl-label">Dice maths</span>
        <span class="tl-title">The Pass Desk</span>
        <span class="tl-text">Tap the target square to see the range and what you need to roll, then the odds that the ball is caught. Throwing a goblin instead? Covered too.</span>
        <span class="btn dark tl-btn">Open the Pass Desk</span>
      </a>
      <a class="tl-card" href="/tools/foul-desk/">
        <img class="tl-head" src="/images/tool-head-foul.jpg" alt="A winking goblin hooligan" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="tl-label">Dice maths</span>
        <span class="tl-title">The Foul Desk</span>
        <span class="tl-text">Assists, Dirty Player, Sneaky Git: how often the boot hurts him, and how often the referee sends you off for it.</span>
        <span class="btn dark tl-btn">Open the Foul Desk</span>
      </a>
      <div class="tl-card tl-soon">
        <span class="tl-label">Coming later</span>
        <span class="tl-title">More on the way</span>
        <span class="tl-text">Got an idea for a tool you'd actually use at the table? <a href="mailto:hello@doubleskulltales.com?subject=Tool%20idea">Send it in</a>.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .tl-kicker { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .3em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--red); }
    .tl-intro { font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .tl-hero { margin: 1.4em 0 0; }
    .tl-hero img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border: 3px solid var(--ink); }
    .tl-hero figcaption { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .78rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; }
    .tl-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin: 1.6em 0 2em; }
    .tl-card { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-top-width: 10px; padding: 20px 22px 22px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; background: var(--paper-dark); }
    a.tl-card:hover { border-top-color: var(--red); color: var(--ink); }
    .tl-soon { background: transparent; border-style: dashed; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: var(--muted); }
    .tl-head { position: absolute; top: -22px; right: 14px; width: 88px; height: 88px; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: var(--paper); object-fit: cover; transition: transform .2s; }
    a.tl-card:hover .tl-head { transform: rotate(-8deg) scale(1.06); }
    a.tl-card .tl-label, a.tl-card .tl-title { padding-right: 92px; }
    .tl-label { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--red); }
    .tl-title { font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif; font-size: 2.2rem; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .tl-text { font-size: 1.1rem; flex: 1; }
    .tl-btn { text-align: center; }
    a.tl-card:hover .tl-btn { background: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); color: var(--paper); }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .tl-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .tl-head { width: 64px; height: 64px; top: -28px; }
      a.tl-card .tl-title { padding-right: 0; }
      a.tl-card .tl-label { padding-right: 70px; }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
